FOOTNOTE OUTPUT IS DISABLED
Identify the complete note stream before excluding it, including unnumbered continuations and diagrams. Assign ALL such parts destination={"kind":"ignored"}; an ignored diagram has no as_image operation. A paragraph break or the end of a printed numbered box does not end a note. Retain genuine main text even if OCR called it a footnote. For mixed sources, split and account for every range. notes and references must be empty. Never promote the next unnumbered paragraph to body just because the numbered notes have been excluded.
{% endif %}

On feedback, correct the named operation while checking the whole affected source/definition/reference set. An operation-field error does not prove that a previously recognised note became body. Reassess reading when source evidence warrants it, not merely to silence a structural error. Return the whole current-page plan with every source accounted for. Do not output markdown fences or prose outside JSON.
